{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8c78100d-3fa9-410e-b0bf-8cadc1824628",
    "name": "Food Delivery API",
    "description": "# 🍔 Food Delivery Microservices API\n\nWelcome to the official Postman collection for the **Food Delivery Microservices Platform**.\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 Microservices Architecture Overview\n\n| Service | Port | Gateway Prefix | Status | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **API Gateway** | `3000` | `/api/*` | 🟢 Active | Central reverse proxy routing requests to all microservices |\n| **Auth Service** | `3001` | `/api/auth` | 🟢 Complete | User authentication, JWT tokens, RBAC & user addresses |\n| **Restaurant Service** | `3002` | `/api/restaurants` | 🟢 Complete | Restaurant catalog, filters, opening hours & menu items |\n| **Order Service** | `3003` | `/api/order` | 🟢 Complete | Order lifecycle management, checkout & user order history |\n| **Delivery Service** | `3004` | `/api/delivery` | 🟡 In Progress | Courier authentication & upcoming delivery fulfillment |\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Dynamic Environment Variables\n\nThis collection automatically extracts and manages the following variables:\n- `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:3000` (API Gateway)\n- `token`: Bearer access token (auto-extracted from login/register response)\n- `refreshToken`: Refresh token for obtaining new access tokens\n- `userId`: Current authenticated user's ID\n- `restaurantId`: ID of the created or selected restaurant\n- `menuItemId`: ID of the created menu item\n- `orderId`: ID of the created order\n\n> 💡 **Tip:** Execute **Register** or **Login** first. The test script will auto-populate `token` and `userId` across the entire collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57587615"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth Service",
      "description": "Handles user registration, login, JWT token lifecycle, user profiles, and address management.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res.data) {",
                  "        if (res.data.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", res.data.accessToken);",
                  "        if (res.data.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "        if (res.data.user && res.data.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", res.data.user.id);",
                  "        console.log(\"✅ Registration successful. Variables set: userId, token, refreshToken\");",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"ozan@delivery.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Ozan\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Demircan\",\n    \"phone\": \"+12125550199\",\n    \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 👤 Register User\nRegisters a new user account with role `customer`, `restaurant_owner`, `courier`, or `admin`.\n\n**Response:** Returns user profile and initial access & refresh tokens. Automatically saves `token`, `refreshToken`, and `userId`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res.data) {",
                  "        if (res.data.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", res.data.accessToken);",
                  "        if (res.data.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", res.data.refreshToken);",
